\paragraph{Trilemma Parameters and Cost Evaluation:} The physically shipped final store structure completely abandons amplitude-independent baseline address limits, generating a strict operational lifetime correlation factor computed at exactly $r=-0.85$ scaling with $a_i^2$. We rigorously refute both standard previously proposed baseline repair variants: directly multiplying absolute payloads exponentially by their matched amplitudes completely corrupts the core value index criterion measured strictly at $A=1-\text{tol}/|a_i|$ (generating hard death physical amplitudes of exactly $0.90/0.80/0.70/0.30$). \emph{Retrieval geometry:} $R_{50}$ contracts $1.146/1.083/0.979/0.874/0.752$ as $A:1\to0.5\to0.2\to0.1\to0.06$, a $1.52\times$ contraction from $1.146\to0.752$, matching the pre-registered saddle prediction at all five points ($\pm0.20$), where a TTL vector store's lookup radius is a constant hard step at $0.75$--$0.77$, independent of age. Consequently, operating beneath the rigid barrier of its internal logic flag, the designated gated execution channel actively contracts the geometric value $R_{50}$ from $1.135\to0.771$. Note crucially that we define no explicit deletion-cost execution statement because the core canonical synchronization mandates a complete and structural $O(n)$ rebuild evaluated entirely per operation.

\section{Prominent Negatives}\label{app:negatives}

To ensure complete transparency regarding the empirical limitations of our findings, every negative result observed during evaluation is documented below. Each negative firmly anchors future research directives.

\begin{center}
\begin{tabular}{p{0.28\linewidth}p{0.66\linewidth}}
\toprule
Claim Tested & Empirical Result\\
\midrule
A continuous coset register emerges purely from training & \textbf{No:} An MLP potential executed on symmetric baseline data yields a completely mid-spectrum massive core mode (measuring exactly $1.7$--$4.9\times$ softer than the peak stiffest point), dropping capacity limit heavily to $\approx1$--$1.6$ structural bits, driving absolute and complete relaxation of any actively written state value. The hard $T=0$ baseline latch geometry is unconditionally designed-only.\\
Raw fundamental $T/\gamma$-exponents explicitly discriminate designed from strict emergent architecture & \textbf{No:} A completely and rigidly matched designed hardware control reliably reproduces perfectly identical shallow execution slopes; purely $\ell_\theta/\Delta$-controlled environmental cells alongside $|\lambda_{\rm coset}|$ successfully discriminate. We quote no $n_{1/2}$ value missing $\Delta$ and $\ell_\theta/\Delta$.\\
The localized friction physical hole safely thermalizes locally & \textbf{Rejected:} Refuted firmly by a rigid pre-registered execution measurement, computing exactly off by a factor of $8.11$. The designated field fundamentally operates entirely absorb-only, and the baseline vault execution computes at $107.77\pm4.78\times$, compared against $13.28\pm0.12\times$ logged for the independent scalar control.\\
Our own explicit sign-flip execution prediction & \textbf{Falsified (in part):} A physical memory register formally written tightly at the established washboard baseline minimum geometrically cannot physically flip back. Both defining operational signs fundamentally coexist successfully on one isolated hardware checkpoint across independent parameters.\\
A friction field can \emph{forget} a coset & No: at $T>0$ it \emph{lengthens} coset memory. Erasing latched content needs a temperature or tilt field --- which explains the observed failure of a learned friction field to recover fit on a stationary vacuum.\\
Amplitude decay reduces an exact adversary's distinguishability & No, at any point in an item's life: white-box AUC $1.000$ at all 18 amplitude levels; what decays is the effect size. The graded curve exists only relative to a stated adversary resolution, our own modeling choice.\\
Canonical placement is exact at overflow without the waitlist & No: $\mathrm{AUC}(n_{\rm live})=1.000$, byte-equal fraction $0.0000$. Every deletion sentence carries its scope clause; recency eviction is permanently excluded.\\
The placement algorithm is ours & No: Blelloch \& Golovin (2007) own it outright, and unique representation in a geometric setting is also taken (2008). Our claim is the composition only.\\
A per-deletion cost claim can be made & No: the shipped synchronization is an $O(n)$ rebuild per operation, so the amortized-cost formalism cannot be instantiated on our own code until that experiment runs.\\
The payload-lifetime coupling has a repair & Both proposed repairs are refuted, and the registered payload-independence statistic fails as a correlation while passing as an effect size. At zero read friction the gated channel is oscillatory, not relaxational.\\
A specific localized pseudo-Goldstone hardware tilt fundamentally sets the primary soft execution scale & \textbf{No:} Local structural geometric confinement completely forces the soft physical baseline eigenvalue explicitly at a limit of $2\alpha$, rigidly capping memory lifespan rigidly at $\tau_{\max}=\Gamma/2\alpha$. The registered physical damped-mode architectural floor is completely confirmed.\\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
\end{center}

